      "body": "Easily swap faces in images and videos, with support for multiple faces and even gender swaps. AdpexAI delivers fast generation speeds and highly realistic results for a smooth, natural look. No downloads required, unlimited photo nd video uploads, and a free trial available. Whether for creative projects, fun edits, or personalized content, AdpexAI makes face swapping effortless.\n\nFeatures:\n\n1. Multi-Format Support – Swap faces in images, videos, GIFs, multiple people, and even across genders.\n2. Free & Easy to Use – Start swapping faces instantly online, with no downloads or technical skills required.\n3. Fast & Accurate – Enjoy quick generation speeds and precise, realistic results powered by advanced AI.\n4. Seamless Experience – Natural motion tracking and lifelike expressions ensure every swap looks authentic.\n5. No Photo and Video Restrictions – Upload and swap faces with any portrait photos, no content limitations.\n6. Privacy & Security – Your photos are processed securely and never stored or shared.",
